  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Bio-Energetic Sourcing</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f4/Lucas_Bishop_%28Marvel_Comics%29_blast.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190901070358\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Lucas Bishop (Marvel Comics) blast\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f4/Lucas_Bishop_%28Marvel_Comics%29_blast.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190901070358\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f4/Lucas_Bishop_%28Marvel_Comics%29_blast.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20190901070358 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/f/f4/Lucas_Bishop_%28Marvel_Comics%29_blast.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20190901070358 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Lucas Bishop (Marvel Comics) blast\" width=\"270\" height=\"408\" data-image-key=\"Lucas_Bishop_%28Marvel_Comics%29_blast.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Lucas Bishop (Marvel Comics) blast.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Lucas Bishop (Marvel Comics) can draw in any form of energy into his body to power himself and redirect it in various ways.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bio-absorb ambient energy</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div><p>The power to <b>bio-absorb ambient energy</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">Energy Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a>.\n</p><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Comics\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comics</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bio-Ambient Energy Manipulation</li>\n<li>Bio-Energetic Channeling</li>\n<li>Bio-Energy/Energetic Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can bio-energetically absorb and manipulate ambient energy. They are able to project energy inward to draw power/absorb from any energy source, enhancing themselves in the process and even redirecting the energy for any purpose.\n</p><p>Said channeling from external sources facilitates the user from absorbing different energies with no ill effects, converting it may be an energetic resource or sustenance.\n</p><p>Said user can also manipulate energy without physical contact; Being able to harness any surrounding energy source means attuning them to the environment it makes up.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alternative_Sustenance\" title=\"Alternative Sustenance\">Alternative Sustenance</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Capacitor\" title=\"Bio-Capacitor\">Bio-Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Accumulation\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Accumulation\">Bio-Energetic Accumulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Concentration\" title=\"Bio-Energy Concentration\">Bio-Energy Concentration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Conversion\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Conversion\">Bio-Energetic Conversion</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electromagnetic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo\">Bio-Electromagnetic Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Electric_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Electric Dynamo\">Bio-Electric Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Photonic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Photonic Dynamo\">Bio-Photonic Dynamo</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Heat_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Heat Dynamo\">Bio-Heat Dynamo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Transduction\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Transduction\">Bio-Energetic Transduction</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Dynamo\">Bio-Ionic Dynamo</a>-<a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Ionic_Furnace\" title=\"Bio-Ionic Furnace\">Furnace</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Plasma_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Plasma Dynamo\">Bio-Plasma Dynamo</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energizing\" title=\"Bio-Energizing\">Bio-Energizing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Living_Power_Plant\" title=\"Living Power Plant\">Living Power Plant</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nuclear_Dynamo\" title=\"Bio-Nuclear Dynamo\">Bio-Nuclear Dynamo</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Reactive_Perpetuator\" title=\"Bio-Reactive Perpetuator\">Bio-Reactive Perpetuator</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Gamma_Reactor\" title=\"Bio-Gamma Reactor\">Bio-Gamma Reactor</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energetic_Physician\" title=\"Bio-Energetic Physician\">Bio-Energetic Physician</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Natural_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Natural Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Natural Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Nature_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Nature Manipulation\">Bio-Nature Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Disaster_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Disaster Manipulation\">Bio-Disaster Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Weather_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Weather Manipulation\">Bio-Weather Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Channeling\" title=\"Channeling\">Channeling</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ambient_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Ambient Energy Manipulation\">Ambient Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Environment_Manipulation\" title=\"Environment Manipulation\">Environment Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Environmental_Adaptation\" title=\"Environmental Adaptation\">Environmental Adaptation</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cultivation\" title=\"Cultivation\">Cultivation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Source_Selection\" title=\"Energy Source Selection\">Energy Source Selection</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Remote Energy Manipulation\">Remote Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Remote_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Remote Energy Absorption\">Remote Energy Absorption</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Energy_Conservation\" title=\"Personal Energy Conservation\">Personal Energy Conservation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Kinetic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Kinetic Energy\">Personal Kinetic Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Activation_Energy\" title=\"Personal Activation Energy\">Personal Activation Energy</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Equivalence\" title=\"Personal Equivalence\">Personal Equivalence</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Heat\" title=\"Personal Heat\">Personal Heat</a></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Techniques\">Techniques</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Bio-Energetic_Sourcing\" title=\"Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing\">Absolute Bio-Energetic Sourcing</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adaptive_Energy\" title=\"Adaptive Energy\">Adaptive Energy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Drain\" title=\"Energy Drain\">Energy Drain</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Replication\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Replication\">Power Replication</a></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ergokinetic_Combat\" title=\"Ergokinetic Combat\">Ergokinetic Combat</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Attacks\" title=\"Energy Attacks\">Energy Attacks</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FBio-Energetic_Sourcing%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Energy Manipulation\">Energy Manipulation</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bio-Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Bio-Energy Manipulation\">Bio-Energy Manipulation</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><sp